ATTRIBUTE	WiMAX-PPAQ				37	tlv

BEGIN-TLV	WiMAX-PPAQ
ATTRIBUTE	WiMAX-PPAQ-Quota-Identifier		1	octets
ATTRIBUTE	WiMAX-Volume-Quota			2	integer #kb
